lot about finance. But the flip is

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:29.074
really just simply this. Don't let your

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:29.680
weakest moment design your budget.

00:06:29.074 --> 00:06:31.480
[music]

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:33.880
So, make the cheap choice the easy

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:35.624
choice before the expensive one becomes

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.720
the only one you can stomach.

00:06:35.624 --> 00:06:37.400
>> [music]

